    {
      "standard_id": "PEFF",
      "name": "PSI Extended FASTA Format (PEFF)",
      "description": "A HUPO-PSI ratified flat-file sequence database format that extends FASTA with a file header and structured per-entry annotation keys to encode database metadata (name, version, source), entry identifiers and taxonomy, post‑translational modifications (ModRes/ModResPsi/ModResUnimod), sequence variants (Variant/VariantSimple/VariantComplex), processed sequences and explicit proteoform definitions for proteogenomics and top‑down proteomics. The spec requires/uses PSI-MS CV terms, provides validators, examples, and multiple reference implementations (e.g. UniProt, neXtProt, Comet, Pyteomics)."
    }
